 rs to contact voters to mobilize support for key civil rights and educate 
 citizens about their voting rights. ACLU of Indiana phone banks are conduc
 ted remotely. No prior experience is necessary. You only need a phone\, co
 mputer\, and internet access to participate from the comfort of your home.
  You will use provided scripts to help voters register\, inform them of wh
 at’s on their ballot or encourage them to turn out to the polls. While 
LOCATION:Virtual event
